WEBVTT

00:10.969 --> 00:12.512
BASED ON THE KINGDOM OF THE GODS BY YLAB

00:12.595 --> 00:14.597
[opening theme music]

01:10.945 --> 01:12.155
[snarls]

01:34.260 --> 01:36.262
[infected snarling]

01:38.848 --> 01:40.683
What should we do?
[breathing anxiously]

01:43.311 --> 01:46.481
We will do everything we can to ensure
Your Highness can escape to safety.

01:46.898 --> 01:48.233
Where does that leave you?

01:48.650 --> 01:50.026
I won't let you all die.

01:50.777 --> 01:52.487
- Not for my sake.
- Your Highness...

01:54.197 --> 01:56.116
someone has to survive tonight.

01:58.159 --> 02:00.078
The people need to know the truth.

02:03.331 --> 02:05.416
[menacing music]

02:13.633 --> 02:16.886
[gunfire]

02:30.525 --> 02:32.986
Bring fire! They are afraid of fire!

02:44.873 --> 02:47.834
- [men shouting]
- [infected snarling]

03:10.732 --> 03:12.567
Father, are you watching?

03:16.988 --> 03:18.114
You see?

03:21.951 --> 03:24.037
They will take nothing from me.

03:51.064 --> 03:52.732
[baby wailing]

04:47.370 --> 04:49.914
[snarling]

04:49.998 --> 04:53.084
There's a chance we can get Your Highness
out through the rear garden.

04:54.460 --> 04:56.129
The main gate is blocked off.

04:56.212 --> 04:58.172
The garden is the last option
we have left.

04:59.007 --> 05:00.550
Your Highness, there's no time.

05:00.633 --> 05:02.552
Let us escort you to the rear garden.

05:02.635 --> 05:04.178
[breathing heavily]

05:09.475 --> 05:11.602
The rear garden.

05:14.897 --> 05:15.732
[gasps]

05:19.277 --> 05:21.821
- How many bullets do we have left?
- Not many, Your Highness.

05:22.322 --> 05:24.324
We don't have enough to take them all out.

05:26.576 --> 05:28.161
The bullets are not for them.

05:33.249 --> 05:34.834
[snarling]

05:41.215 --> 05:44.635
[Chang] If we become the bait ourselves,
this may work.

05:47.722 --> 05:49.724
[tense music]

05:51.976 --> 05:52.894
[snarling]

06:16.167 --> 06:18.252
[exhales forcefully, whimpers]

06:22.799 --> 06:24.425
[yells in pain]

06:30.348 --> 06:31.474
[sniffs]

06:31.557 --> 06:33.351
[snarls]

06:34.310 --> 06:36.312
[tense music]

06:49.117 --> 06:51.160
Keep your eyes open!
Don't look at the ground!

06:51.536 --> 06:53.496
[screams]

07:04.257 --> 07:05.800
[gasps, screams]

07:09.178 --> 07:10.471
[snarls]

07:10.555 --> 07:12.598
- [screams]
- [snarling]

07:21.941 --> 07:23.067
Watch your step.

07:34.704 --> 07:36.205
[snarling]

09:20.893 --> 09:21.936
[snarling]

09:43.291 --> 09:45.876
[pants]
It looks like they sealed off the gates.

09:46.627 --> 09:47.795
[sighs]

09:49.297 --> 09:50.673
Your Highness,

09:51.424 --> 09:54.260
what on earth is going on
inside the palace?

09:55.136 --> 09:56.887
- [banging, rattling]
- [infected snarling]

09:56.971 --> 09:57.930
[screeching]

09:58.014 --> 09:59.890
[rapidly retreating footsteps]

10:17.283 --> 10:19.327
[baby whimpers]

10:28.419 --> 10:29.420
[gasps in alarm]

10:33.549 --> 10:35.092
[baby cries]

10:43.142 --> 10:45.811
[somber music]

10:45.895 --> 10:47.021
[Chang] Dongnae,

10:48.022 --> 10:48.898
Sangju,

10:50.024 --> 10:51.901
we failed to stop the plague.

10:53.819 --> 10:55.529
I won't let that happen again.

10:56.739 --> 10:59.075
I will stop it, no matter what it takes.

11:18.052 --> 11:20.054
[stirring music]

11:46.080 --> 11:48.165
[suspenseful music]

11:57.258 --> 11:58.217
[wind whistling]

11:58.300 --> 11:59.343
[whimpering]

12:00.928 --> 12:02.555
[rapidly approaching footsteps]

12:02.638 --> 12:04.348
[panicked whimpering]

12:12.523 --> 12:14.400
[rousing music]

12:22.241 --> 12:25.536
[snarling]

12:32.626 --> 12:34.211
Do it now! Fire!

13:04.825 --> 13:06.535
[panting]

13:12.082 --> 13:14.376
[screams]

13:18.172 --> 13:19.215
No, no, no!

13:21.300 --> 13:24.887
Don't touch me! Get away from me!
Stay back! Stay back!

13:26.931 --> 13:28.224
[screaming]
Get off me!

14:21.443 --> 14:23.821
[shrieks]

14:39.712 --> 14:40.796
[groans]

14:52.600 --> 14:53.517
[grunts aggressively]

15:16.373 --> 15:18.375
[ominous music]

16:06.507 --> 16:08.509
[booming snarl]

16:36.662 --> 16:38.080
[Chang yells furiously]

17:06.275 --> 17:08.569
[tense music]

17:35.345 --> 17:37.347
[foreboding music]

18:37.074 --> 18:41.036
[gasping, panting]

18:53.507 --> 18:55.592
How did we survive that?

18:55.676 --> 18:57.010
We all got bitten by them.

18:57.636 --> 18:58.929
I do not know...

18:59.513 --> 19:01.348
but we're alive.
[grunts]

19:46.310 --> 19:49.730
Your Royal Highness.
Long live our new King.

19:51.398 --> 19:54.234
[councilors] Long live our new King!

19:56.528 --> 19:58.363
Your Highness, I'm glad you are safe.

19:59.573 --> 20:01.617
Please tell me, what on earth
happened last night?

20:02.034 --> 20:04.244
Send what troops
we have left to the palace.

20:04.328 --> 20:07.122
Bring our men down from the walls,
as quick as you can.

20:17.674 --> 20:20.510
Have you completed pulling the bodies
out of the reservoir?

20:20.594 --> 20:21.553
[soldier] Yes, sir.

20:22.596 --> 20:23.555
[sighs]

20:41.782 --> 20:42.616
[gasps]

20:45.619 --> 20:46.787
Seo-bi...

20:58.006 --> 21:01.718
You're serious?
The plague spread into the palace?

21:01.802 --> 21:03.220
Who lived through the night?

21:05.013 --> 21:08.767
Did everyone die except
for Your Highness and your guard?

21:11.728 --> 21:13.438
Including the Queen...

21:14.314 --> 21:16.066
and all of the ministers too?

21:16.149 --> 21:17.192
Yes.

21:20.237 --> 21:21.863
What news do you have?

21:23.198 --> 21:25.659
We were not able to locate
the Prince's corpse.

21:27.536 --> 21:29.079
We must find him.

21:30.122 --> 21:31.873
Princes cannot simply disappear.

21:31.957 --> 21:34.710
I know there were guards
that escaped last night.

21:34.793 --> 21:39.172
Also, many rural magistrates
support the Haewon Cho Clan.

21:39.673 --> 21:41.508
If that child is alive,

21:41.591 --> 21:44.761
those who support him will be sure
to revolt in the future.

21:45.387 --> 21:47.180
For Your Highness' survival,

21:47.889 --> 21:52.060
this child must be put to death
by your hand.

22:16.460 --> 22:17.753
[snarls]

22:41.735 --> 22:44.196
YEONGYEONG GATE

22:44.279 --> 22:46.281
[somber music]

23:00.170 --> 23:01.380
This room...

23:04.883 --> 23:07.260
it was built to house portraits...

23:08.970 --> 23:12.182
as a way to honor kings
past and present.

23:12.766 --> 23:14.393
This is my bloodline.

23:14.810 --> 23:17.896
These portraits are placed on the throne
as if they were alive.

23:17.979 --> 23:20.232
We perform our ancestral rites...

23:22.401 --> 23:24.111
to honor their legacies.

23:24.861 --> 23:27.155
But there are two shrines
that remain empty.

23:28.031 --> 23:29.366
[baby coos]

23:30.742 --> 23:33.745
This one here was made for my father.

23:34.871 --> 23:36.081
And the other...

23:40.544 --> 23:42.546
This last one was built for me.

23:42.838 --> 23:44.631
[baby gurgles]

23:47.134 --> 23:48.260
Therefore...

23:50.971 --> 23:52.681
you shall come out at once.

24:18.874 --> 24:20.167
Let me see him.

24:23.920 --> 24:25.464
Show me this child.

24:30.802 --> 24:32.846
[baby cooing]

24:33.346 --> 24:34.181
[unsheathes sword]

24:35.891 --> 24:37.184
This child has been bitten?

24:37.267 --> 24:40.103
He has been bitten, yes,
but he is not a monster.

24:41.521 --> 24:42.397
Trust me, sir.

24:42.481 --> 24:44.608
This child is not stricken
with the plague.

24:45.859 --> 24:47.360
You must not kill him, please.

24:49.863 --> 24:50.947
Don't do this, sir.

24:51.031 --> 24:53.283
I know that you do not want
to end his life.

24:53.700 --> 24:56.453
Highness, you asked me to protect him.

24:58.121 --> 24:59.873
I have done that for you.

25:00.123 --> 25:01.583
Go to the Queen's side...

25:02.292 --> 25:03.877
keep watch on her baby.

25:04.294 --> 25:07.172
You mean the Prince?
The Queen's newborn, Your Highness?

25:08.006 --> 25:09.883
Sir, there is something
I have to tell you.

25:10.300 --> 25:12.719
It has to do with the Queen
and her newborn son.

25:14.763 --> 25:17.224
- The child is not--
- I already know the truth.

25:20.101 --> 25:22.020
That child is Mu-yeong's son.

25:23.563 --> 25:24.439
So, I...

25:26.900 --> 25:28.944
I need you to watch over him.

25:30.529 --> 25:34.658
Highness, you said that no one else
should get hurt, remember?

25:35.242 --> 25:38.161
So please, spare this child's life.

25:39.037 --> 25:40.914
This plague will come to an end.

25:41.289 --> 25:43.083
And this will all be a bad memory.

25:43.667 --> 25:45.085
Winter will be spring.

25:45.585 --> 25:47.295
This nightmare will be done.

25:47.629 --> 25:48.797
[breathing shakily]

25:58.640 --> 25:59.641
No.

26:01.685 --> 26:03.353
As long as this child lives...

26:05.605 --> 26:07.524
this terror will never end.

26:12.237 --> 26:14.656
HONGCHI GATE

26:15.949 --> 26:19.244
THE CITADEL OF SANGJU

26:19.327 --> 26:22.706
3 MONTHS LATER

26:28.503 --> 26:29.379
[sighs]

26:32.757 --> 26:35.760
- [indistinct chatter]
- [women wailing]

26:44.311 --> 26:47.147
[indistinct chatter, sobbing]

27:00.201 --> 27:05.206
JONGMYO SHRINE, 7 YEARS LATER

27:11.504 --> 27:13.840
[man] Begin!

27:16.509 --> 27:19.220
[traditional music playing]

28:22.617 --> 28:24.911
[somber music]

28:27.914 --> 28:29.916
[breathing shakily]

28:40.552 --> 28:41.720
Highness.

28:47.559 --> 28:49.394
It's time for us to head back.

29:01.781 --> 29:04.576
Someone told me
that Your Majesty would like to see

29:04.659 --> 29:06.369
the records from seven years ago.

29:06.828 --> 29:08.663
But surely you already know

29:09.372 --> 29:11.040
we sealed the records of that time

29:11.124 --> 29:13.752
so not even the kings can know
what happened back then.

29:13.835 --> 29:16.004
No one will tell me how my family died.

29:18.465 --> 29:21.926
My parents, my brother,
both passed seven years ago.

29:23.636 --> 29:26.055
All anyone tells me is it was the plague.

29:26.139 --> 29:28.892
Now the plague killed all the court ladies
and the guards.

29:29.642 --> 29:32.353
However, neither you nor uncle...

29:33.605 --> 29:36.316
no one here will tell me anything
about who they were.

29:37.984 --> 29:39.819
So, who should I ask about this?

29:46.451 --> 29:49.037
The royal lecture will begin shortly,
Your Highness.

29:51.581 --> 29:52.749
The lessons you'll learn there

29:52.832 --> 29:55.126
will be valuable
in helping the country thrive.

29:55.210 --> 29:57.962
The more you learn,
the better you can lead the royal court

29:58.046 --> 29:59.756
and look after the people of Joseon.

30:06.930 --> 30:07.847
Escort His Majesty.

30:17.232 --> 30:20.527
[councilor] Our young King misses
his parents more and more by the day.

30:20.610 --> 30:25.073
It would be too much for him to learn
what really happened to them back then.

30:25.156 --> 30:26.741
He'd be devastated.

30:26.825 --> 30:29.577
We must do what we can
to ensure His Majesty never finds out.

30:37.502 --> 30:40.630
HANYANG

30:48.096 --> 30:50.682
Oh? Oh, wait, wait, wait! I know you!

30:52.433 --> 30:54.811
Yeong-sin? It is you, isn't it?

30:55.436 --> 30:56.938
It's been a while, my lord.

30:58.106 --> 30:59.148
Good to see you.

30:59.732 --> 31:02.443
[laughing]

31:04.279 --> 31:07.407
[laughing continues]

31:07.490 --> 31:09.784
[slurring]
Oh, stop being so formal.

31:09.868 --> 31:12.954
- Talk to me like your friend.
- You're drinking so much.

31:13.037 --> 31:14.330
Haven't you had enough?

31:14.914 --> 31:17.959
I'm only drinking this much
because I'm having dinner with you.

31:18.042 --> 31:22.130
- [sighs] Loosen up, will you?
- [chuckles]

31:22.922 --> 31:25.592
All right, fine. Then I will.

31:26.259 --> 31:29.178
Huh? I'm the Second State Councilor.

31:29.637 --> 31:32.473
Somebody!
This guy's getting chummy with me!

31:32.557 --> 31:35.310
- [laughing]
- And speaking of titles...

31:35.768 --> 31:38.605
what would people say if they saw
a court official sitting there,

31:38.688 --> 31:39.898
eating up all their food, huh?

31:40.189 --> 31:42.984
[both laugh]

31:43.067 --> 31:44.444
You couldn't be more right.

31:44.777 --> 31:46.487
I don't know how I ended up here.

31:46.988 --> 31:50.617
You know, back in Dongnae,
I only took the magistrate position

31:50.700 --> 31:52.577
because if I didn't, my uncle said

31:52.660 --> 31:54.662
he'd make me a eunuch.
[laughs]

31:54.746 --> 31:57.373
But I am the Second State Councilor now.

31:58.166 --> 32:01.336
But you know what,
it's a lot of responsibility.

32:01.711 --> 32:03.421
I gotta look good all the time,

32:03.504 --> 32:06.299
and I never get to drink like this.
[laughs]

32:08.051 --> 32:11.346
But you're doing great things.
Order is being restored.

32:11.846 --> 32:13.473
Gyeongsang has recovered.

32:14.015 --> 32:15.975
This country has overcome so much.

32:16.809 --> 32:18.102
I've seen it firsthand.

32:19.270 --> 32:20.480
That's enough.

32:21.606 --> 32:24.734
Don't make me talk
about serious matters with you, okay?

32:25.234 --> 32:27.070
Just enjoy the wine.
[chuckles]

32:32.867 --> 32:35.578
How's the King? Is he in good health?

32:40.416 --> 32:41.960
He is growing up well.

32:42.335 --> 32:46.381
He may be young, but he's already finished
The Four Books and The Three Classics.

32:46.464 --> 32:49.425
He'll grow up to be a wise king, I'm sure.

32:52.512 --> 32:54.055
I'm doing my best.

32:55.181 --> 32:57.725
After all,
this is what His Highness wanted.

33:01.187 --> 33:02.230
[screams]

33:02.313 --> 33:04.857
[tense music]

33:23.710 --> 33:25.795
Tell me right now, can I trust you?

33:27.088 --> 33:28.631
Are you sure this child...

33:29.674 --> 33:31.426
is not sick with the disease?

33:32.010 --> 33:33.428
I'm sure of it, sir.

33:34.303 --> 33:36.931
The monsters left bites
all over his hand and feet.

33:37.390 --> 33:38.808
I put him in water and saved him.

33:39.475 --> 33:41.394
I saw the worms come out of him myself.

33:41.811 --> 33:42.979
[Kim Sun] Do not spare him!

33:43.062 --> 33:46.441
That child is the legitimate heir
to the throne.

33:47.233 --> 33:49.235
He is the only threat to your rule.

33:49.861 --> 33:52.363
You'll bring chaos across the country.

33:55.366 --> 33:56.784
Two cannot rule.

33:56.868 --> 33:58.536
There can only be one.

33:58.870 --> 34:00.371
Just kill the boy at once.

34:05.501 --> 34:07.754
I'll accept that you're right
about one thing.

34:09.630 --> 34:11.215
Between the two of us,

34:12.759 --> 34:14.761
one of us will need to be put to death.

34:18.973 --> 34:20.016
That said...

34:23.561 --> 34:25.563
which of us truly deserves to die?

34:27.482 --> 34:30.234
He is a prince
and the only legitimate heir.

34:31.027 --> 34:32.070
And I...

34:34.280 --> 34:36.032
I'm not even the Queen's son.

34:37.992 --> 34:40.411
I killed my father with my bare hands.

34:43.581 --> 34:45.917
If you must choose between the two of us,

34:49.837 --> 34:51.214
which one do we need more

34:51.297 --> 34:55.343
to rule this starving,
plague-ridden country torn apart by war?

34:57.261 --> 34:59.722
I ask you, which would you choose to live?

35:04.852 --> 35:06.896
- This child...
- [baby coos]

35:06.979 --> 35:09.565
...may be the only hope left
for our kingdom.

35:10.149 --> 35:11.818
The ones who intended to use him

35:11.901 --> 35:14.821
to seize power for themselves
have all been killed by now.

35:17.115 --> 35:18.324
So, please...

35:21.702 --> 35:23.246
guide this prince to rule...

35:24.288 --> 35:25.665
[breathing shakily]

35:25.748 --> 35:28.209
...so that he can become a wise
and fair king.

35:28.292 --> 35:29.877
[poignant music]

35:35.341 --> 35:36.592
[sighs]

35:41.973 --> 35:43.474
I trust you with this.

35:46.227 --> 35:47.770
And the ministers...

35:49.522 --> 35:51.607
who are virtuous and loyal to you.

35:59.157 --> 36:00.491
[sighs]

36:06.122 --> 36:07.039
We can't do this.

36:07.498 --> 36:08.666
What if that child...

36:09.458 --> 36:11.586
is not the descendant of the former king?

36:13.838 --> 36:14.964
He is.

36:17.091 --> 36:18.342
I assure you.

36:20.720 --> 36:23.556
I am his brother
and he has the blood of a king.

36:26.058 --> 36:28.436
Please write
that the war killed my father,

36:31.230 --> 36:34.025
as well as the Queen,
whom I called mother.

36:36.819 --> 36:38.362
And I was killed too.

36:41.324 --> 36:43.409
That is how the history should read.

36:46.787 --> 36:49.582
This is the gift that I offer this land...

36:52.293 --> 36:54.629
as a descendant of the royal blood.

38:02.989 --> 38:05.533
I wonder how His Highness is.

38:06.409 --> 38:07.410
I mean,

38:07.493 --> 38:10.705
he's got Seo-bi hanging around him,
so I'm sure he's well.

38:16.794 --> 38:17.920
[sighs]

38:21.090 --> 38:23.342
- What is that?
- It's a journal.

38:23.718 --> 38:25.469
It contains all of her notes
on the plague.

38:29.307 --> 38:30.599
[Beom-pal gasps]

38:31.684 --> 38:33.019
[Seo-bi] The plague began

38:33.102 --> 38:36.689
when a handful of dead
were revived with the resurrection plant.

38:36.772 --> 38:40.359
The eggs of the worms on the plant
seize control of the brain,

38:40.443 --> 38:42.194
thus raising the dead.

38:42.278 --> 38:45.281
The resurrected lose all ability
to reason,

38:45.364 --> 38:48.743
they feel no pain, and quickly develop
an insatiable hunger

38:48.826 --> 38:50.578
for human flesh and blood.

38:51.037 --> 38:52.705
A bite from these monsters

38:52.788 --> 38:55.708
transfers the worms
into the new host's bloodstream,

38:55.791 --> 38:57.668
but it does not transform them.

38:58.294 --> 39:01.047
However, it will lower
the body's temperature

39:01.130 --> 39:02.757
until they eventually die.

39:03.924 --> 39:07.720
The disease initially began spreading
at Jiyulheon in Dongnae.

39:08.012 --> 39:09.597
The people there cooked and ate the flesh

39:10.056 --> 39:13.392
of someone who had died
after being bitten by a plague victim.

39:13.809 --> 39:17.188
Those who ate that person
suffered convulsions before dying,

39:17.271 --> 39:19.023
and became monsters themselves.

39:19.440 --> 39:21.817
After this particular interaction,

39:21.901 --> 39:25.279
all those who are bitten
immediately turned into mindless beasts.

39:26.322 --> 39:29.116
Not everyone who is bitten
turns into a monster.

39:30.284 --> 39:33.704
If a bite victim plunges their wound
in water before death,

39:33.788 --> 39:36.457
it will remove the worms
before they can reach the brain,

39:36.540 --> 39:38.501
thus eliminating the disease.

39:40.086 --> 39:44.340
In addition, newborns are immune
to the disease even if they are bitten

39:44.423 --> 39:46.384
because their brains
are not yet fully developed.

39:49.387 --> 39:54.141
The worms thrive in colder temperatures,
so they lie dormant in spring and summer.

39:54.850 --> 39:56.060
In autumn and winter,

39:56.143 --> 39:58.771
their active hours are limited
to when the sun is up.

39:59.146 --> 40:02.149
Then from the winter solstice
to the first day of spring,

40:02.233 --> 40:05.111
the monsters remain active
throughout the day and night.

40:05.903 --> 40:07.446
But in all my research,

40:07.530 --> 40:10.241
I still have not found
the answer to one question.

40:10.658 --> 40:14.453
It is a certainty to me
that the worms favor cold temperatures,

40:14.537 --> 40:18.124
but for some reason,
extreme heat causes them to thrive.

40:18.541 --> 40:20.126
and spread even more viciously.

40:20.626 --> 40:21.961
There must be a secret.

40:22.044 --> 40:24.755
Something still hidden
behind the resurrection plant.

40:27.758 --> 40:31.011
Seo-bi is still trying to determine
what causes the disease?

40:31.679 --> 40:32.721
[gasps]

40:35.015 --> 40:36.892
The plague was wiped out seven years ago.

40:36.976 --> 40:38.561
No, not completely.

40:39.854 --> 40:41.689
The plant doesn't just grow in Sangju.

40:42.189 --> 40:43.649
It has also been found elsewhere.

40:43.732 --> 40:46.360
- In which region?
- Well, there's been many.

40:46.944 --> 40:50.823
Gyeongsang, the Three Provinces,
Gyeonggi, Gangwon, and Hwanghae.

40:50.906 --> 40:53.409
We found the resurrection plant
all over the country.

40:53.492 --> 40:54.869
RESURRECTION PLANT

40:54.952 --> 40:56.245
[foreboding music]

41:26.567 --> 41:28.277
This is the resurrection plant.

41:31.822 --> 41:33.199
[breathing anxiously]

41:35.701 --> 41:36.785
[Yeong-sin] My lord!

41:38.245 --> 41:39.205
[gasps]

41:46.128 --> 41:48.380
I brought the elder and his son
from the nearby village.

41:50.633 --> 41:51.717
These plants...

41:52.551 --> 41:54.136
when did they start growing here?

41:54.595 --> 41:55.930
Oh, yes.

41:56.639 --> 41:57.681
Well...

41:59.058 --> 42:00.976
we planted these a while ago.

42:01.810 --> 42:03.229
What do you mean by that?

42:03.312 --> 42:04.438
You planted these?

42:05.606 --> 42:07.191
Who exactly gave you the seeds?

42:07.608 --> 42:08.609
Well...

42:09.443 --> 42:12.112
my son here followed a merchant to China

42:12.613 --> 42:14.156
to earn some money.

42:15.282 --> 42:17.618
He got those plants near the Yalu River.

42:17.701 --> 42:20.829
We planted them,
thinking we can make money off of them.

42:22.248 --> 42:23.165
Is that true?

42:23.582 --> 42:24.917
Yes, my lord.

42:25.417 --> 42:27.503
I was told it brings back the dead.

42:27.795 --> 42:29.964
I thought I could make money off it.

42:30.297 --> 42:32.424
I couldn't sell it
because no one believed me,

42:32.508 --> 42:33.592
so I just left them.

42:36.929 --> 42:39.014
[foreboding music]

42:44.478 --> 42:46.855
Are you certain someone sold that plant
to those men?

42:47.273 --> 42:48.524
Yes, I'm sure.

42:49.191 --> 42:51.068
He even knew exactly what to do
with the plant

42:51.151 --> 42:52.736
to bring the dead back to life.

42:53.070 --> 42:55.781
Whoever it was gave him instructions.

42:56.907 --> 42:58.033
[sighs]

42:59.493 --> 43:01.370
Who would sell such a dangerous thing?

43:01.453 --> 43:02.621
Good question.

43:02.705 --> 43:05.916
His Highness thought I should come here
and let you know about this matter.

43:06.000 --> 43:07.751
And I was told to give this journal to you

43:08.168 --> 43:09.628
in case there's another outbreak.

43:11.547 --> 43:14.216
Where is His Highness? Where is he going?

43:14.842 --> 43:16.719
He's gone to the Northern Region...

43:19.179 --> 43:21.140
to track down the person behind this.

43:21.223 --> 43:23.183
[ominous music]

43:23.267 --> 43:24.602
HWANGHAE PROVINCE

43:25.519 --> 43:26.562
HAMGYONG PROVINCE

43:41.243 --> 43:43.078
- Where is it?
- Here, sir.

43:43.495 --> 43:46.707
Everything has been left behind,
but the people seem to have vanished.

43:52.630 --> 43:55.090
[eerie music]

44:21.742 --> 44:22.910
[object cracks]

44:59.863 --> 45:00.906
I found the plant.

45:02.700 --> 45:03.909
[jingling]

45:08.247 --> 45:09.832
"There must be a secret.

45:11.375 --> 45:15.045
Something still hidden
behind the resurrection plant."

45:16.422 --> 45:18.424
[ominous music]

45:42.906 --> 45:46.118
[jingling]

45:50.998 --> 45:53.083
[jingling continues]

45:59.882 --> 46:00.883
[breathing anxiously]

46:06.013 --> 46:07.931
[infected screeching, snarling]

46:29.745 --> 46:33.248
[bells jingling]

46:35.125 --> 46:37.002
[distant snarling]

46:38.086 --> 46:40.672
[bells jingling]

46:46.303 --> 46:49.348
- [bell jingling loudens]
- [distant snarling]

46:58.315 --> 47:00.359
- [bells jingling]
- [snarling]

47:03.028 --> 47:05.531
[clattering]

47:06.907 --> 47:08.951
[menacing music]

48:02.921 --> 48:04.923
[closing theme music]
